XThis patch fixes two problems:
X  1)  The messages that appear on the bottom line never "disappear", now
X	they are removed after you make your next move.
X  2)  The help window creates problems with certain systems by not redrawing
X	the grid screen properly after it goes away, now, of course, it does.
X
